     | leaf-STHHH1-b-1 | leaf-LDX6-a-1 | leaf-LDI18-b-1 | leaf-LDI18-b-2 | leaf-IMM7-a-1 | leaf-LDS12-c-1 | leaf-LDS12-c-2 | leaf-STBu12-a-1
